  "label": "Historical Eugenics Programs",
  "description": "The meme references the real-world historical practice of eugenics, particularly in the United States, where forced sterilization and other coercive population control measures were implemented against marginalized groups, including Black people, under the guise of public health and racial purity. The image of restraint is a visual metaphor for these coercive medical interventions.",
